  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FF UNICEF Vietnam: Climate Smart Evacuation Centre (CSEC): Advancing Child Centered Climate Resilience in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF&apos;s Climate Smart Evacuation Centre (CSEC) Project will support Viet Nam&apos;s National Adaptation Plan (NAP) objectives for climate-adapted and disaster-resilient infrastructure, by piloting a proof-of-concept, low-cost retrofit of an existing public facility into a climate resilient green and inclusive evacuation centre - demonstrating how integrated, risk informed multi-purpose infrastructure can protect vulnerable communities, support year-round community use.</narrative>
  </description>
